# tourism-kb/.gitignore — luat ignore rieng cho san pham Tourism KB.
#
# NOI DUNG LA PII, KHONG PHAI DUNG LUONG. raw/ + wiki/ + output/ deu la du lieu
# SINH RA, tai tao duoc tu code/ + raw tho, va deu dan xuat tu ~14.328 so di
# dong Viet Nam THAT cua ho kinh doanh nho (voi ho mot nguoi, "so doanh nghiep"
# CHINH LA so ca nhan). Repo nay chuyen CONG KHAI trong luc /ship de lay CI mien
# phi, nen commit dong nghia voi cong bo.
#
# Chi code/ (script) duoc theo doi. Danh sach nay phai noi CUNG MOT DIEU voi
# THU_MUC_CHO_PHEP trong code/duong_dan_ra.py va voi G8 trong
# ../scripts/audit/greppable-invariants.sh — sua mot ben ma quen ben kia thi
# guard PII tro thanh vo nghia. Xem CLAUDE.md.
#
# (Gitignore KHONG cho phep chu thich cuoi dong — moi luat mot dong rieng.)

# Du lieu tho + trung gian; raw/build/ giu moc neo parity .docx.
raw/

# Tai lieu ban giao (.md, TRANG-THAI.md).
wiki/

# Ba ban phat hanh .docx + output/archive/.
output/

# Output sinh ra roi vao thu muc script — lop lot cua diem_den_chot.json (tung
# bi COMMIT vi no roi vao thu muc code chu khong phai thu muc du lieu).
code/*.json
